    "summary": "The user asks about demographic shifts during urban revitalization, specifically inquiring about the types of people who move in and leave. While the assistant initially provides a standard sociological answer, it later makes a highly problematic association between departing residents and \"chronic offenders,\" which the user pushes back on. The assistant ultimately acknowledges that these labels are often stigmatizing and linked to systemic issues.",
